# A card Library of Leng puts into the library is not revealed unless the discarding effect revealed it (the rulings), and
# one put there unrevealed has all its characteristics undefined (CR 701.9c), its abilities among them. Turn 1: Bot1's
# Faithless Looting discards a Titanbones, Towering Heart, which Bot1 puts on top of the library unseen - Bot2 does not see
# it, and its "when you discard this card, you gain 3 life" does not trigger. Turn 2: Bot2's Thoughtseize reveals Bot1's
# hand and takes the other Titanbones; revealed by the effect discarding it, it goes on top of the library known to all,
# and its trigger functions there (CR 113.6k): Bot1 gains 3 life.
